---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { SITE_EMAIL } from '../config/site';

const canonicalUrl = 'https://calcumetrics.com/privacy-policy';

const jsonld = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@graph': [
    {
      '@type': 'WebPage',
      name: 'Privacy Policy',
      url: canonicalUrl,
      description: 'How Calcumetrics handles your data, including advertising cookies and user privacy choices.',
      publisher: { '@id': 'https://calcumetrics.com/#org' },
    },
    {
      '@type': 'BreadcrumbList',
      itemListElement: [
        { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 1, name: 'Home', item: 'https://calcumetrics.com/' },
        { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 2, name: 'Privacy Policy', item: canonicalUrl },
      ],
    },
  ],
};
---
<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | Calcumetrics"
  description="How Calcumetrics handles your data, including our use of Google AdSense advertising cookies and your consent choices."
  canonical={canonicalUrl}
>
  <Fragment slot="head"><script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(jsonld)} /></Fragment>
  <div class="max-w-[700px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="mb-6">
      <ol class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs text-text-muted">
        <li><a href="/" class="hover:text-accent transition-standard">Home</a></li>
        <li aria-hidden="true">›</li>
        <li class="text-text-primary font-medium" aria-current="page">Privacy Policy</li>
      </ol>
    </nav>
    <p class="text-xs text-text-muted mb-2">Last updated: 24 September 2026</p>
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-text-primary mb-6">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">
      Effective date: 24 September 2026. This policy describes how Calcumetrics collects, uses, and shares information when you use our website at calcumetrics.com.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-text-primary mt-8 mb-3">1. Who we are and how to contact us</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">
      Calcumetrics is an independent financial calculator website. For any privacy-related query or to exercise your rights, contact us at: <a href={`mailto:${SITE_EMAIL}`} class="text-accent hover:underline focus-visible:outline-accent">{SITE_EMAIL}</a>.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-text-primary mt-8 mb-3">2. What we collect</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed mb-2"><strong>Calculator inputs:</strong> All calculator inputs are processed entirely in your browser. They are not transmitted to our servers, not stored, and not sent to any third party. Calculator state may be saved to your browser's URL hash (for share links) or <code>localStorage</code> (for remembered currency preference — key: <code>cm_currency</code>). This data stays on your device only.</p>
    <p class="text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed mb-2"><strong>Self-hosted typography:</strong> All fonts (Inter and Playfair Display) are self-hosted directly on our origin servers. We do not load fonts, scripts, or styles from Google Fonts, Google CDN, or other third-party font networks, guaranteeing that no IP address or browser telemetry is shared with external font providers.</p>
    <p class="text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed mb-4"><strong>Cookieless web analytics:</strong> We use Cloudflare Web Analytics to monitor aggregate traffic, page views, and performance. Cloudflare Web Analytics is privacy-first, 100% cookieless, and does not use <code>localStorage</code> or fingerprinting. It does not track you across other websites, does not collect personal identifiers, and does not retain IP addresses.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-text-primary mt-8 mb-3">3. Cookies and browser storage</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">
      Calcumetrics does <strong>not</strong> set any tracking cookies or third-party advertising cookies. We only use functional browser storage (<code class="text-xs bg-disabled-bg px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono">localStorage</code>) to preserve your explicit user interface choices:
    </p>
    <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-sm text-text-muted mb-4 pl-2">
      <li><code>cm_currency</code>: Remembers your selected currency symbol (e.g., INR, USD, EUR) across tools.</li>
      <li><code>cm_theme</code>: Remembers your light/dark mode preference if toggled.</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">
      This data resides exclusively on your local device and is never sent to our servers. You can clear this data at any time via your browser settings. For full details, see our <a href="/cookie-policy" class="text-accent hover:underline focus-visible:outline-accent">Cookie Policy</a>.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-text-primary mt-8 mb-3">4. Advertising and future consent</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">
      Third-party advertising (such as Google AdSense) is not currently active on this site. If we introduce advertising or cookie-based services in the future, we will deploy a certified Consent Management Platform (CMP) and update this policy prior to activation. No ad network or tracking scripts will execute without appropriate user consent.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-text-primary mt-8 mb-3">5. Legal bases and your rights</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">
      Depending on your location, you may have rights under GDPR/UK GDPR (access, correction, deletion, restriction, portability, objection, withdrawal of consent), India's Digital Personal Data Protection Act 2023, or applicable US state privacy laws (CCPA/CPRA and others). To exercise any right, contact us at <a href={`mailto:${SITE_EMAIL}`} class="text-accent hover:underline focus-visible:outline-accent">{SITE_EMAIL}</a>.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-text-primary mt-8 mb-3">6. Data retention and security</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">
      We do not store calculator inputs on any server. Aggregate analytics data from Cloudflare Web Analytics is retained per Cloudflare's privacy guidelines. We enforce HTTPS, HSTS, and strict security headers.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-text-primary mt-8 mb-3">7. Children</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">
      This site is not directed at children under 13 (or the applicable age of digital consent in your country). We do not knowingly collect personal data from children. If you believe a child has provided us with personal data, contact us and we will delete it.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-text-primary mt-8 mb-3">8. Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
      We update this policy when our practices change. The "Last updated" date at the top reflects the date of the last material change. Continued use of the site after a change constitutes acceptance of the updated policy.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>
